    "number": 12,
    "title": "Document selective tower shuffle and challenge schedules",
    "body": "## Summary\n\n- replace the invalid whole-key-swap comparison with a selective key-rotation specification\n- define a 6-key by 8-icon keypad and pressed-keys-plus-one shuffle\n- compare uniform 3-of-6 challenges with alternating {1,2,3}/{4,5,6}\n- document worked rotations, state advancement, security hypotheses, and future benchmark metrics\n\n## Validation\n\n- verified both numeric layouts preserve 48 unique icons and untouched rows\n- verified exactly two immediate candidate destinations\n- verified uniform overlap distribution and candidate-space formulas\n- `git diff --check`",
